  inherited by path, not re-derived: THM-2422 (summand closure P minus {1,4,6}; M_t = 27*2^(t-4)+1), THM-2433, THM-362; summand reflection three modes 1/4/6; synthesis sections 1-12; counterexample_portrait (SHEET-BLIND vs SIGN-SPECIFIC).
  the three components {1,3,6,8,10}, {2,7,9}, {4,5,11,12} of Q_12 are NOT the summand module {1,4,6}: 1 and 6 share a component, 4 sits in a third; no map found beyond the cardinality 3.
  untouched paste items (SCOPE, no square-sum content): 196 = 14^2 horizon, 2363 = 17*139 clock, octonion monodromy, 0.700 bits, 'martingale decay per sheet'.

